# A play-by-mail game, the Allied turn: the game starts with the PBM file that pbm-1942-axis wrote
# (tests/data/pbm/1942-allied.pbm). Continue PBM Game shows the news of the Axis turn ("New Axis
# Infantry recruited in Dresden"), then "CONTINUING PBM GAME", then plays the update of October
# 1942 again, from the seed the file holds. The Allied side then plays November 1942: it ends its
# turn at once. The game writes the PBM file for the Axis player, shows "PBM File has been saved"
# and ends.
#! seed 1942
#! start pbm/1942-allied.pbm pbm
#! files pbm

rule 1 key space

# The title menu: Continue PBM Game. The news, then "CONTINUING PBM GAME".
play until 2:W
digest
text c
play until 5
digest
key space
play until 1
digest
key space

# The update, then the Allied main menu: END TURN, Yes.
play until 2:M
digest
text e
play until 2:E
text y
play until 1
digest
repeat space
